            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mt-0 mb-2">Rule 1 – Commencement</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary m-0">These rules take effect from the date of Gazette publication (June 30, 2026) and supersede all prior rules, instructions, or orders concerning recruitment to this post.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl">
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mt-0 mb-2">Rule 3 – Appointment</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary m-0">Appointment is by nomination from the candidates recommended by the MPSC, based strictly on the results of the competitive examination.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-l-rose-500">
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mt-0 mb-2">Rule 4 – Departmental Exam</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary m-0">The appointed candidate must clear the Departmental Exam (conducted by META, Nashik) within the prescribed time and attempts.</p>
            <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs font-bold text-rose-500 bg-rose-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-rose-500/20">
