            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-l-rose-500">
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mt-0 mb-2">Rule 5 – Marathi & Hindi Language Exam</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary m-0">Appointees must clear the Hindi and Marathi language proficiency exams within the prescribed time limit after taking office.</p>
            <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs font-bold text-rose-500 bg-rose-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-rose-500/20">
              ⚠ Non-compliance: Increments and promotions are withheld until cleared.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-l-rose-500">
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mt-0 mb-2">Rule 6 – Computer Certificate</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary m-0">Appointees must obtain the prescribed computer operations certificate (e.g. MS-CIT) within the government's specified time limit.</p>
            <span class="inline-block mt-3 text-xs font-bold text-rose-500 bg-rose-500/10 px-3 py-1 rounded border border-rose-500/20">
              ⚠ Non-compliance: Increments and promotions are suspended until the certificate is obtained.
            </span>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl">
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mt-0 mb-2">Rule 7 – Small Family Declaration</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary m-0">A formal declaration under the Small Family Rules 2005 is mandatory. More than two children (either at declaration, appointment, or later in service) disqualifies the person from service.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl">
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mt-0 mb-2">Rule 8 – Transfer</h4>
            <p class="text-sm text-text-secondary m-0">As seniority lists are maintained at the State level, appointed candidates are liable to be transferred anywhere within the state of Maharashtra.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-bg-surface border border-border-card p-6 rounded-2xl">
            <h4 class="text-text-main font-bold mt-0 mb-2">Rule 9 – Other Orders</h4>
